  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Product Direction**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started by taking a look at the user request to get oriented. I\'m focusing on the product\'s direction, the proposed architecture, and the pages specified. Right now, I\'m specifically looking at the `/` (or `overview`) landing page with its interactive 3D model viewer. This seems like a core element to consider.\n\n\n**Analyzing Page Features**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down into the specific features planned for each page. I\'m prioritizing understanding how the interactive 3D explorer on `/infrastructure` will function and how it relates to risk visualization. I also plan to see how the `/risk-quantification` section, with its FAIR model, will integrate with the overall user experience and provide actionable insights. I\'m focusing on the interplay between data, risk scores, and user actions.\n\n\n**Defining Core Visuals**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the detailed visual requirements of the 3D infrastructure centerpiece. My focus is on representing a realistic yet stylized digital infrastructure core with dynamic data-flow pathways that indicate normal and suspicious traffic. I\'m exploring the visual interplay between the server core, the cloud nodes, and the connected endpoints. Status indicators and the overall user experience will be critical. I must also consider the layout of the UI elements.\n\n\n**Detailing Interactions and Architecture**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the interaction details of the 3D viewer. I\'ve considered all control aspects: orbit, zoom, pan, touch gestures, and camera resets. The raycasting interaction is key; I\'ve planned smooth camera movements to a selected node, displaying its risk factors and allowing easy access to investigation tools. I\'ve also outlined visual toggles for labels, risk heatmaps, data flow, quality levels, and an alternative 2D map. Lastly, I\'ve started defining a modular architecture in `src/`, specifying type definitions, and planning to use realistic synthetic datasets.\n\n\n**Defining Data & Architecture**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the data model and API structure. I\'ve defined the infrastructure nodes with detailed vulnerabilities and FAIR models. I\'m building a simulated API service (`apiService.ts`) with endpoints for dashboard summary, assets, and detections. I am also implementing real-time stream simulation and local persistence for managing mitigations and alerts. I\'m also planning the three.js rendering engine and controls.\n\n\n**Mapping Page Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now outlining all the UI components, focusing on the planned page structure in `src/pages/`. I have begun mapping the React components: `OverviewPage.tsx`, `DashboardPage.tsx`, `InfrastructurePage.tsx` and all other related pages. I\'m focusing on their key features like the 3D model, the risk overviews, and threat maps. My next step will be to explore their visual and interactive designs.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4272038"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"export type RiskLevel = \'healthy\' | \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\' | \'critical\';\\n\\nexport type AssetCategory = \\n  | \'core-datacenter\'\\n  | \'cloud-cluster\'\\n  | \'gateway-firewall\'\\n  | \'database\'\\n  | \'app-service\'\\n  | \'endpoint-workstation\'\\n  | \'iot-edge\';\\n\\nexport interface Vulnerability {\\n  id: string;\\n  cve: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  severity: RiskLevel;\\n  cvss: number;\\n  exploitAvailable: boolean;\\n  attackVector: \'Network\' | \'Adjacent\' | \'Local\' | \'Physical\';\\n  description: string;\\n  remediation: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface InfrastructureNode {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  hostname: string;\\n  ipAddress: string;\\n  category: AssetCategory;\\n  tier: \'Perimeter\' | \'Ingress\' | \'Application\' | \'Core Data\' | \'Management\';\\n  riskScore: number; // 0 to 100\\n  compromiseProbability: number; // 0 to 100%\\n  businessCriticality: \'Tier 1\' | \'Tier 2\' | \'Tier 3\';\\n  financialExposure: number; // in USD\\n  status: \'online\' | \'degraded\' | \'under-investigation\' | \'quarantined\';\\n  lastUpdated: string;\\n  position3D: [number, number, number];\\n  connections: string[]; // Connected node IDs\\n  vulnerabilities: Vulnerability[];\\n  anomaliesCount: number;\\n  cpuLoad: number;\\n  dataThroughputMbps: number;\\n  operatingSystem: string;\\n  environment: \'AWS us-east-1\' | \'GCP asia-east\' | \'On-Premises Core\' | \'Edge DC\';\\n  owner: string;\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DataFlowLink {\\n  id: string;\\n  source: string;\\n  target: string;\\n  protocol: \'HTTPS\' | \'gRPC\' | \'TLS-DB\' | \'SSH\' | \'IPSec\';\\n  trafficVolumeMbps: number;\\n  isSuspicious: boolean;\\n  threatLabel?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AnomalyDetection {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  assetId: string;\\n  assetName: string;\\n  detectedAt: string;\\n  severity: RiskLevel;\\n  compromiseProbability: number;\\n  mitreTactic: string;\\n  mitreTechnique: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  evidence: string[];\\n  status: \'active\' | \'investigating\' | \'contained\' | \'resolved\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Investigation {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  incidentCommander: string;\\n  startedAt: string;\\n  severity: RiskLevel;\\n  status: \'open\' | \'containment-in-progress\' | \'mitigated\' | \'closed\';\\n  targetAssetIds: string[];\\n  threatVector: string;\\n  estimatedLossAvoided: number;\\n  timeline: {\\n    timestamp: string;\\n    event: string;\\n    actor: string;\\n    type: \'alert\' | \'action\' | \'forensic\' | \'containment\';\\n  }[];\\n  mitigationSteps: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Recommendation {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  targetAssetId: string;\\n  targetAssetName: string;\\n  priority: \'P1 - Critical\' | \'P2 - High\' | \'P3 - Moderate\';\\n  effortDays: number;\\n  estimatedCostUSD: number;\\n  riskReductionScore: number;\\n  financialRiskReductionUSD: number;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'applied\' | \'in-review\';\\n  actionType: \'Patching\' | \'Segmentation\' | \'Credential Rotation\' | \'WAF Rule\' | \'Egress Lockdown\';\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ThreatIntelligenceReport {\\n  id: string;\\n  threatActor: string;\\n  campaignName: string;\\n  targetedIndustries: string[];\\n  targetedCVEs: string[];\\n  confidence: \'High\' | \'Medium\' | \'Confirmed\';\\n  summary: string;\\n  firstSeen: string;\\n  iocs: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FAIRMetrics {\\n  totalExpectedLossUSD: number;\\n  annualizedLossExposureUSD: number;\\n  singleLossExpectancyUSD: number;\\n  valueAtRisk95PercentileUSD: number;\\n  lossFrequencyPerYear: number;\\n  lossMagnitudeMinUSD: number;\\n  lossMagnitudeMaxUSD: number;\\n  lossMagnitudeProbableUSD: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EnterpriseRiskSummary {\\n  overallRiskScore: number; // 0 - 100\\n  riskTrend: number; // e.g. -4.2%\\n  activeAssetsCount: number;\\n  highRiskAssetsCount: number;\\n  criticalAnomaliesCount: number;\\n  fairMetrics: FAIRMetrics;\\n  industryBenchmarkScore: number;\\n  compliancePosturePercentage: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport type ViewerQuality = \'auto\' | \'high\' | \'medium\' | \'low\';\\n\\nexport interface UserPreferences {\\n  theme: \'dark\';\\n  quality: ViewerQuality;\\n  autoRotate: boolean;\\n  showLabels: boolean;\\n  showRiskOverlay: boolean;\\n  showDataFlow: boolean;\\n  reducedMotion: boolean;\\n  simulatedLiveUpdates: boolean;\\n  prefer2DMap: boolean;\\n}\\n\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Create types index.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create types definition\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 19945636
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
