  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the 3D Engine**\n\nI\'m focusing now on the 3D engine and centerpiece design. I\'m visualizing a large, interactive 3D model viewer as the hero, occupying a significant portion of the desktop visual area. The design leans toward a stylized but realistic digital infrastructure core, starting with a central secure data center.\n\n\n**Constructing the Server Core**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the server core\'s specifics: network nodes, server racks, firewalls, and the cloud. I\'m visualizing subtle data flow paths with pulsing packets, and how to highlight asset risk with color and pulsating alerts. Orbit and touch controls are my immediate focus, including camera reset and auto-rotate. WebGL detection and a 2D fallback map are crucial, too, with smooth camera focusing on asset clicks.\n\n\n**Refining the Visualization Engine**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the Three.js scene manager for optimal performance, ensuring clean code. I\'m focusing on PBR materials, utilizing MeshStandardMaterial and MeshPhysicalMaterial with adjustable roughness and metalness. Emissive channels will highlight risk alerts and server rack activity. I\'m also visualizing the ground grid with cyber rings and metallic finish. The server racks, central data center vault, cloud clusters, perimeter firewalls, and data-flow conduits are coming to life visually, with animated energy pulses. Raycasting with pointer events will be key.\n\n\n**Implementing Camera Transitions**\n\nI\'m now implementing smooth camera animations using `THREE.Vector3.lerp` for node selection and reset actions. I\'m also adding HTML overlay billboards for node labels, projected in 3D using CSS. I\'m focusing on providing quality presets: High with PBR and shadows, Medium with standard materials, and Low with unlit materials. Memory management is critical, with cleanup and event listener detachment for optimal performance.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2721501"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { InfrastructureNode, DataFlowLink } from \'../../types\';\\nimport { Shield, Server, Database, Cloud, Laptop, AlertTriangle, CheckCircle, ExternalLink } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface TwoDTopologyFallbackProps {\\n  nodes: InfrastructureNode[];\\n  links: DataFlowLink[];\\n  selectedNodeId: string | null;\\n  onSelectNode: (nodeId: string) => void;\\n  showRiskOverlay: boolean;\\n  showDataFlow: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TwoDTopologyFallback: React.FC<TwoDTopologyFallbackProps> = ({\\n  nodes,\\n  links,\\n  selectedNodeId,\\n  onSelectNode,\\n  showRiskOverlay,\\n  showDataFlow\\n}) => {\\n  // Map 3D positions [x, y, z] to 2D SVG coordinates\\n  // Range of x: approx -6 to +6 -> map to 80 to 920\\n  // Range of z: approx -5 to +5 -> map to 60 to 540\\n  const get2DPos = (pos: [number, number, number]): { x: number; y: number } => {\\n    const x = ((pos[0] + 6) / 12) * 800 + 80;\\n    const y = ((pos[2] + 5) / 10) * 440 + 60;\\n    return { x, y };\\n  };\\n\\n  const getNodeIcon = (category: string) => {\\n    switch (category) {\\n      case \'database\':\\n        return <Database className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />;\\n      case \'cloud-cluster\':\\n        return <Cloud className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />;\\n      case \'gateway-firewall\':\\n        return <Shield className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />;\\n      case \'endpoint-workstation\':\\n        return <Laptop className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />;\\n      default:\\n        return <Server className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />;\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const getRiskBorderColor = (score: number) => {\\n    if (!showRiskOverlay) return \'#334155\';\\n    if (score >= 80) return \'#ef4444\'; // Red critical\\n    if (score >= 65) return \'#f97316\'; // Orange high\\n    if (score >= 40) return \'#eab308\'; // Amber medium\\n    return \'#10b981\'; // Green healthy\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[480px] bg-[#07090e] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n      {/* Background blueprint grid */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#1e293b_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] opacity-25 pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n\\n      {/* Header bar */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute top-3 left-4 z-10 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 bg-slate-900/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 backdrop-blur\\\">\\n        <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n        <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-200\\\">2D Topological Map</span>\\n        <span className=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">| Accessible Architecture Graph</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <svg \\n        className=\\\"w-full h-full min-h-[500px]\\\" \\n        viewBox=\\\"0 0 960 600\\\"\\n        preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid meet\\\"\\n        role=\\\"region\\\"\\n        aria-label=\\\"2D Cybersecurity Infrastructure Map\\\"\\n      >\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"normalFlowGrad\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"0%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"100%\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#06b6d4\\\" stopOpacity=\\\"0.4\\\" />\\n            <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#3b82f6\\\" stopOpacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n          </linearGradient>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"threatFlowGrad\\\" x1=\\\"0%\\\" y1=\\\"0%\\\" x2=\\\"100%\\\" y2=\\\"100%\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#f97316\\\" stopOpacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n            <stop offset=\\\"100%\\\" stopColor=\\\"#ef4444\\\" stopOpacity=\\\"0.9\\\" />\\n          </linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n\\n        {/* Data flow connections */}\\n        {links.map((link) => {\\n          const sourceNode = nodes.find((n) => n.id === link.source);\\n          const targetNode = nodes.find((n) => n.id === link.target);\\n          if (!sourceNode || !targetNode) return null;\\n\\n          const p1 = get2DPos(sourceNode.position3D);\\n          const p2 = get2DPos(targetNode.position3D);\\n          const isSuspicious = link.isSuspicious;\\n\\n          // Quadratic curved path\\n          const midX = (p1.x + p2.x) / 2;\\n          const midY = (p1.y + p2.y) / 2 - 20;\\n          const d = `M ${p1.x} ${p1.y} Q ${midX} ${midY} ${p2.x} ${p2.y}`;\\n\\n          return (\\n            <g key={link.id}>\\n              <path\\n                d={d}\\n                fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                stroke={isSuspicious ? \'url(#threatFlowGrad)\' : \'#1e293b\'}\\n                strokeWidth={isSuspicious ? 2.5 : 1.5}\\n                strokeDasharray={isSuspicious && showDataFlow ? \'6,4\' : undefined}\\n                className={isSuspicious && showDataFlow ? \'animate-pulse\' : \'\'}\\n              />\\n              {showDataFlow && (\\n                <circle r={isSuspicious ? 3.5 : 2.5} fill={isSuspicious ? \'#ef4444\' : \'#38bdf8\'}>\\n                  <animateMotion\\n                    path={d}\\n                    dur={isSuspicious ? \'2s\' : \'3.5s\'}\\n                    repeatCount=\\\"indefinite\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </circle>\\n              )}\\n            </g>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n\\n        {/* Nodes */}\\n        {nodes.map((node) => {\\n          const pos = get2DPos(node.position3D);\\n          const isSelected = selectedNodeId === node.id;\\n          const borderColor = getRiskBorderColor(node.riskScore);\\n\\n          return (\\n            <g\\n              key={node.id}\\n              id={`2d-node-${node.id}`}\\n              transform={`translate(${pos.x}, ${pos.y})`}\\n              className=\\\"cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-110\\\"\\n              onClick={() => onSelectNode(node.id)}\\n              tabIndex={0}\\n              role=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-label={`${node.name}, Risk score: ${node.riskScore}, Status: ${node.status}`}\\n              onKeyDown={(e) => {\\n                if (e.key === \'Enter\' || e.key === \' \') {\\n                  e.preventDefault();\\n                  onSelectNode(node.id);\\n                }\\n              }}\\n            >\\n              {/* Selection aura */}\\n              {isSelected && (\\n                <circle\\n                  r={28}\\n                  fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                  stroke=\\\"#06b6d4\\\"\\n                  strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\"\\n                  strokeDasharray=\\\"4 4\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"animate-spin origin-center\\\"\\n                />\\n              )}\\n\\n              {/* Status pulse if high risk */}\\n              {node.riskScore >= 70 && (\\n                <circle\\n                  r={22}\\n                  fill=\\\"#ef4444\\\"\\n                  opacity=\\\"0.2\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"animate-ping\\\"\\n                />\\n              )}\\n\\n              {/* Main Node Background */}\\n              <circle\\n                r={18}\\n                fill=\\\"#0f172a\\\"\\n                stroke={isSelected ? \'#38bdf8\' : borderColor}\\n                strokeWidth={isSelected ? 3 : 2}\\n              />\\n\\n              {/* Icon / Status representation */}\\n              <foreignObject x={-10} y={-10} width={20} height={20} className=\\\"pointer-events-none\\\">\\n                <div className={`w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center ${isSelected ? \'text-cyan-400\' : \'text-slate-300\'}`}>\\n                  {node.category === \'database\' && <Database className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n                  {node.category === \'gateway-firewall\' && <Shield className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n                  {node.category === \'cloud-cluster\' && <Cloud className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n                  {node.category === \'endpoint-workstation\' && <Laptop className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n                  {node.category === \'app-service\' && <Server className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />}\\n                </div>\\n              </foreignObject>\\n\\n              {/* Node Label */}\\n              <text\\n                x={0}\\n                y={28}\\n                textAnchor=\\\"middle\\\"\\n                className=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium fill-slate-300 pointer-events-none\\\"\\n              >\\n                {node.name.length > 20 ? `${node.name.substring(0, 18)}...` : node.name}\\n              </text>\\n\\n              {/* Risk Badge */}\\n              <text\\n                x={0}\\n                y={40}\\n                textAnchor=\\\"middle\\\"\\n                className=\\\"text-[9px] font-mono font-semibold pointer-events-none\\\"\\n                fill={node.riskScore >= 70 ? \'#f87171\' : node.riskScore >= 40 ? \'#fbbf24\' : \'#34d399\'}\\n              >\\n                Score: {node.riskScore}\\n              </text>\\n            </g>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </svg>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/three/TwoDTopologyFallback.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Create 2D topology fallback component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create TwoDTopologyFallback.tsx\"}"
