    session_summary: "1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Fix Compilation and Linter Errors (IMPLEMENTATION):** The application currently fails to build due to type mismatches and incorrect API method calls in `App.tsx`.\n- **Finalize Responsive Design and Accessibility (NOT STARTED):** Ensure the application is fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile, and meets WCAG 2.1 AA standards.\n- **Implement Testing and CI/CD (NOT STARTED):** The user requested unit, integration, and E2E tests, along with a CI/CD pipeline.\n- **Build the complete application shell and integrate the 3D viewer (COMPLETED):** Shell, navigation, and all pages are implemented.\n- **Implement the remaining pages and navigation (COMPLETED):** All pages defined in the master prompt are created.\n\n2. User Knowledge\n- **Design Philosophy:** \"Premium, modern, intelligent, minimal but information-rich, dark, cinematic, and technically sophisticated.\"\n- **3D Hero Experience:** The 3D model must be the \"visual centerpiece\" and \"hero experience,\" occupying 50\342\200\22365% of the hero visual area on desktop.\n- **Accessibility:** Must be WCAG 2.1 AA compliant, with a non-visual equivalent (2D map) for the 3D viewer.\n- **Data:** Use synthetic data for demonstrations; clearly distinguish it from live integrations.\n\n3. Work Accomplished\n- **Application Shell:** Created `TopNavigation.tsx` and `Sidebar.tsx` with responsive layouts and state-driven navigation.\n- **Page Implementation:** Created all 11 required pages: `OverviewPage`, `DashboardPage`, `InfrastructurePage`, `AssetsPage`, `DetectionsPage`, `InvestigationsPage`, `RiskQuantificationPage`, `ThreatIntelligencePage`, `RecommendationsPage`, `ReportsPage`, and `SettingsPage`.\n- **App Integration:** Implemented `App.tsx` with hash-based routing, global state management (nodes, anomalies, etc.), and integration of all page components.\n- **Bug Fixes:** Fixed a spread operator error in `ThreeInfrastructureViewer.tsx` (`nodeGroup.position.set(...node.position3D)` was invalid, changed to explicit coordinates).\n- **Data Layer:** Verified `apiService.ts` and `types/index.ts` structures, though minor integration mismatches remain.\n\n4. Model Knowledge\n- **Architecture:** React SPA using a centralized `apiService` singleton. State is shared via props in `App.tsx`.\n- **Routing:** Hash-based routing (`window.location.hash`) is used to manage page views.\n- **API Mismatches (Critical):**\n  - `App.tsx` calls `apiService.getNodes()` and `getLinks()`, but `apiService.ts` exposes `getAssets()` and `getInfrastructureGraph()`.\n  - `App.tsx` calls `apiService.startLiveSimulation()`, but the method is not defined in `apiService.ts`.\n  - `App.tsx` calls `apiService.quarantineNode()`, but the method is `quarantineAsset()`.\n- **Type Mismatches (Critical):**\n  - `App.tsx` and `RecommendationsPage.tsx` import `RemediationRecommendation` from `../types`, but the interface is named `Recommendation` in `src/types/index.ts`.\n- **Persistence:** `apiService` uses `localStorage` for `nodes`, `recommendations`, and `anomalies`.\n\n5. Files and Code\n- **Edited Files:**\n  - `/src/App.tsx`: Integrated all components and routing. (Needs API method fixes).\n  - `/src/components/three/ThreeInfrastructureViewer.tsx`: Fixed spread operator in `position.set`.\n- **Created Files:**\n  - `/src/components/layout/TopNavigation.tsx`: Main header.\n  - `/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx`: Navigation sidebar.\n  - `/src/pages/*.tsx`: All 11 page components.\n- **Viewed Files:**\n  - `/src/types/index.ts`: Contains core interfaces. Note: `Recommendation` is the correct name, not `RemediationRecommendation`.\n  - `/src/services/apiService.ts`: Contains the API implementation. Note: Method names (`getAssets`, `quarantineAsset`) differ from `App.tsx` usage.\n  - `/src/data/cyberData.ts`: Contains initial state.\n\n6. Current Work and Next Steps\n- **Current Work:** The application is structurally complete but failing to compile due to the mismatches noted in \"Model Knowledge.\"\n- **Next Steps:**\n  1.  **Fix Types:** Update `App.tsx` and `RecommendationsPage.tsx` to import `Recommendation` instead of `RemediationRecommendation` (or alias it).\n  2.  **Fix API Calls:** Update `App.tsx` to use the correct `apiService` methods:\n      - Change `getNodes()` to `getAssets()`.\n      - Change `getLinks()` to `getInfrastructureGraph().links`.\n      - Change `quarantineNode()` to `quarantineAsset()`.\n      - Implement or remove the `startLiveSimulation` call if not supported by the current `apiService` class.\n  3.  **Verify:** Run `npm run lint` (or `tsc --noEmit`) to ensure all compilation errors are resolved."
