    thinking: "**Constructing Geometry Cache**\n\nI\'m now building the `ThreeInfrastructureViewer.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on optimizing geometry and material management. Right now, I\'m working on creating a central cache to house all the necessary geometries and materials to avoid re-creation and duplications, specifically including a dark base cylinder, halo torus, selection torus, and a database core cylinder, along with the database object.\n\n\n**Expanding Geometry Cache**\n\nI\'ve significantly expanded the geometry cache to include a disc torus, several box objects (firewall shield, firewall bar, workstation, server rack), an icosahedron cluster, and a screen plane. I\'ve also incorporated new risk materials and the cyan selection aura. I\'m focusing on static object matrix updates now, setting `matrixAutoUpdate` to `false` and ensuring manual matrix updates to optimize performance. I\'m also implementing unrestricted 360-degree rotation now, including azimuth and elevation controls.\n\n\n"
